{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的感受层有时过于密集，个别联想如“年少时初恋的下午”把音乐引出的感觉说得太具体，容易抢过人物本身的心理变化。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用加亮的关键词建立了清楚的视觉锚点，普通观众不用逐字读完就能抓住每段人物心理的变化；感受文字与音乐小节同步出现，也让情绪发展有了具体的时间和层次。Y的完整叙述在解释人物动机时略胜一筹，但右侧短词缺少明确的主次和音乐时间对应，容易变成一组需要自行拼接的感受。总体而言，X更容易让人一边听音乐一边理解人物，并且通过反复出现的水波、摇荡、失重、靠岸等意象感受到整首曲子的连续性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cb96dd53-d889-48eb-817b-b8614212d73a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T062455904313Z", "elapsed_seconds": 81.953, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:26:17.855038+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "59d0c265fe732e251413f009c54b94fd6d719a89d24feadffd15b72ece31d2c0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgp